OL,3,ARAF Fairford incident involves 'foreign
OL,4,Aactor', says Rubio, as some evacuated
OL,5,Aresidents return home
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS Secretary of State Marco Rubio says
OL,8,Fthe weekend incident at RAF Fairford
OL,9,F"clearly involves the hands of a
OL,10,Fforeign actor"
OL,12,FSpeaking to US media, he doesn't give
OL,13,Ffurther details but thanks UK
OL,14,Fauthorities for being "cooperative" and
OL,15,F"helpful"
OL,17,FFive men arrested on suspicion of
OL,18,Fterror offences near the base, which is
OL,19,Fused by the US military, were released
OL,20,Fon bail on Monday - here's what else we
OL,21,Fknow
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/41
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
