OL,3,ALives 'will be lost' unless UK does
OL,4,Amore to combat wildfires, committee
OL,5,Achairwoman says
OL,6,
OL,7,FLives "will be lost" unless more is
OL,8,Fdone to combat the increasing risk of
OL,9,Fwildfires, the chairwoman of the UK's
OL,10,FClimate Change Committee (CCC) has said
OL,11,Fafter a record number of blazes this
OL,12,Fsummer.
OL,14,FBaroness Brown told BBC File on 4
OL,15,FInvestigates "not enough action" had
OL,16,Fbeen taken in light of predictions the
OL,17,FUK is facing longer, drier summers
OL,18,Fbecause of global warming.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/41
