OL,3,AArgentina threatens legal action
OL,4,Aagainst UK over Falkland Islands oil
OL,5,Aexploration
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe comments heighten tensions between
OL,8,Fthe UK and Argentina over the
OL,9,Fsovereignty of the archipelago, known
OL,10,Fin Argentina as Las Malvinas, more than
OL,11,F40 years after a British military task
OL,12,Fforce ejected Argentine forces which
OL,13,Fhad invaded the territory in 1982.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/41
